# TC003 - Validate Invalid Product Quantity Input in Cart



## Test Scenario
Attempt to add a product to the cart using invalid quantity values.



## Objective
Validate that the system correctly handles invalid quantity inputs and prevents adding products with invalid values to the shopping cart.



## Preconditions
User is on the Products page.

URL: https://automationexercise.com/products



## Test Steps
1. Navigate to the Products page  
2. Select a product from the list  
3. Click on "View Product"  
4. Enter invalid quantity values:
   - 0  
   - 100000000000000000  
5. Click on "Add to cart"  
6. Click on "View Cart"  



## Expected Result
The system should prevent the product from being added to the cart when invalid quantity values are entered and should:
- Reject invalid quantity inputs  
- Display a validation message OR block the action  
- Maintain cart data integrity  



## Actual Result
The system allows the product to be added to the cart even when invalid quantity values (0 or extremely large numbers) are entered, without displaying any validation message or restriction.



## Status
Failed



